{"products": [{"Наименование": "Engine Control", "Модель": "EC325", "Описание краткое": "An electronic-mechanical unit for remote control of the gas and reverse of an outboard or stationary motor. The ability to connect multiple control posts. The location of the posts at any distance from the engines.", "Описание подробное": "It includes a controller and a servo drive that simultaneously controls the rods for the throttle and reverse cables. \n Two versions (chassis or aluminum housing 230x160x130mm)\n The operating voltage is 12 V.\n It is designed to control gas and reverse by means of two standard C8 cables. \n \n A typical NMEA2000 cable is used to connect to the ENG-HUB. Do not use a cable longer than 5 meters. \n ??When installing a single motor, it is possible to connect to Remote Control directly, without the ENG-HUB and CTRL-HUB. In this case, an additional power supply unit is installed instead of the ENG-HUB.??\n \n Blocking the engine start when the gear is switched on is optional. \n Service control of the motor from the unit housing (ignition, \"start\" and \"stop\" buttons) is optional.\n The choice of the operating mode of the motor (the speed range for the full stroke of the post handle) is optional.\n Cruise control (speed control) is optional.\n The ability to control from a phone/tablet is optional.", "Цена": "2750"}, {"Наименование": "Motor Turn", "Модель": "MT425", "Описание краткое": "An electronic-mechanical unit for remote control of the turn. The ability to connect multiple control posts. The location of the posts at any distance from the engine.", "Описание подробное": "It allows you to remotely control the rotation of an outboard boat motor with a power of up to 115 hp. It is possible to control a swing-out column, a steering wheel pen. It includes an electric cylinder that controls the rotation of an outboard boat motor through a standard M66 steering cable. The operating voltage is 12 V.", "Цена": "3600"}, {"Наименование": "ENG-HUB", "Модель": "EH125", "Описание краткое": "Switching unit for control of two motors", "Описание подробное": "Up to eight motors are optional.", "Цена": "930"}, {"Наименование": "CTRL-HUB", "Модель": "CH125", "Описание краткое": "A switching unit for organizing control from two posts", "Описание подробное": "Up to four posts are optional.\n Connecting a phone/tablet as a control post is optional.", "Цена": "680"}, {"Наименование": "Remote Control", "Модель": "DRC225", "Описание краткое": "Remote control. Throttle and reverse with one lever. Any distance from the motors. The possibility of duplicating posts.", "Описание подробное": "A double block of levers for controlling the throttle/reverse of two motors. Simultaneous control of two motors with one hand.", "Цена": "680"}, {"Наименование": "Remote Control", "Модель": "DRC226", "Описание краткое": "Remote control. Throttle and reverse with one lever. Any distance from the motors. The possibility of duplicating posts.", "Описание подробное": "A dual lever block for controlling the throttle/reverse of two engines with trim controls, engine operating modes: maneuvering, cruise and trolling. Cruise control unit.\n Simultaneous control of two motors with one hand.", "Цена": "1050"}, {"Наименование": "Remote Control", "Модель": "SRC225", "Описание краткое": "Remote control. Throttle and reverse with one lever. Any distance from the motor. The possibility of duplicating posts.", "Описание подробное": "A lever for controlling the throttle/reverse of one motor.", "Цена": "400"}, {"Наименование": "Remote Control", "Модель": "SRC226", "Описание краткое": "Remote control. Throttle and reverse with one lever. Any distance from the motor. The possibility of duplicating posts.", "Описание подробное": "A lever for controlling the throttle / reverse of one engine with a trimmer, engine operating modes: maneuvering, cruise and trolling. Cruise control unit.", "Цена": "550"}, {"Наименование": "Remote Control App", "Модель": "ARC126", "Описание краткое": "Remote control of one or two motors from an Android device.", "Описание подробное": "An application that can be configured for the required number of motors, allowing you to control the motors: start, stop, throttle, reverse, turn. \n Up to eight motors - optional", "Цена": ""}, {"Наименование": "Transformable control posts.", "Модель": "CRC000", "Описание краткое": "Steering racks, consoles, tables, instrument panels", "Описание подробное": "Design, installation, commissioning of control posts for ships. Transformable control posts.", "Цена": ""}, {"Наименование": "A table-mounted panel for two engines.", "Модель": "CP000", "Описание краткое": "Table-mounted control panel (ignition, start, stop) for two engines", "Описание подробное": "A table-mounted panel with control valves (ignition, start, stop) for two engines. It can be supplemented with buttons for remote on/off of the mass, devices.", "Цена": ""}, {"Наименование": "Motor Lift", "Модель": "ML324", "Описание краткое": "A transom with an electric drive for adjusting the height of the outboard motor.", "Описание подробное": "The transom is designed to adjust the height of the outboard motor on the move and to fully lift the motor out of the water for maintenance and preservation. \n The operating voltage is 12 V. \n Stroke height is 680 mm. \n Weight 23.4 kg. \n Load capacity 250 kg.\n The permissible engine power is 80 hp.", "Цена": "3500"}, {"Наименование": "Hydraulic Selector", "Модель": "HS124", "Описание краткое": "Control of two motors with one steering wheel. You can combine/separate the motors, or control them synchronously. Significantly increases the maneuverability of the vessel.", "Описание подробное": "An electronic-hydraulic unit that allows for both synchronous and asynchronous control of the rotation of outboard motors (swing-out columns, rudders) from a single steering wheel. Provides the ability to steer either of the two engines separately, or two engines simultaneously. \n The ability to connect the car steering wheel is optional.", "Цена": "6000"}, {"Наименование": "Hydraulic Block", "Модель": "HB124", "Описание краткое": "Blocks the operation of one or more steering control posts. It allows you to control the turn from only one of the available posts.", "Описание подробное": "An electronic hydraulic unit that allows you to lock the steering. It is used when there are two or more control posts on the ship.", "Цена": "4150"}, {"Наименование": "Aft bathing/transportation platform", "Модель": "SP121", "Описание краткое": "Aft bathing/transportation platform on four electric cylinders.", "Описание подробное": "Load capacity 600 kg. Stroke height is 800 mm. 3.36 x 1.75 meters. The time of full ascent from the bottom to the top position is 2 minutes. The operating voltage is 12 volts. A built-in locker for fenders, vests, etc. is equipped with a built-in keel block. It is used for launching/lifting and transporting a tender or a jet ski. It provides a convenient descent to the water for diving, spearfishing, and swimming. It provides convenient access for replacing propellers and for engine maintenance.", "Цена": "16500"}, {"Наименование": "Aft bathing/transportation platform", "Модель": "SP226", "Описание краткое": "Aft bathing/transportation platform on a bracket with electric drive.", "Описание подробное": "Load capacity ??? kg. Stroke height ??? mm. The size is individually customized. The time of full ascent from the bottom to the top position is 1 minute. \n The operating voltage is 12 volts.\n It is equipped with removable keel blocks. It is used for launching/lifting and transporting a tender or a jet ski. It provides a convenient descent to the water for diving, spearfishing, and swimming. It provides convenient access for replacing propellers and for engine maintenance.", "Цена": ""}, {"Наименование": "BoatSupport", "Модель": "BT121", "Описание краткое": "A device for safely towing a boat.", "Описание подробное": "Mechanical mooring and damping device for convenient towing of a boat/ tender behind a yacht/floating house. It does not limit the maneuverability of the vessel - mooring, maneuvering, and reversing are possible. Provides the necessary strokes and rolls of the towed boat at a wave height of up to 0.7 meters. Provides convenient loading/unloading, boarding/disembarking of passengers.", "Цена": "490"}, {"Наименование": "Ramp", "Модель": "BA118", "Описание краткое": "Composite bow platform that descends onto the shore or pier", "Описание подробное": "Two-part. The length is 1.5+1.2 meters. The width is 2.16 meters. The take-out is 1.7 meters. The descent from the deck level is 780 mm. The angle of entry is 15 degrees. Load capacity 800 kg. For convenient access to the unequipped shore, for entry/ exit and transportation of bicycles, quad bikes.", "Цена": "10400"}, {"Наименование": "Antenna", "Модель": "IA125", "Описание краткое": "A directional device. Provides a stable internet connection in difficult conditions.", "Описание подробное": "The directional antenna (80⁰) is mounted on a motorized mast with 360⁰ rotation. Turn control is a wireless remote control. The supply voltage is 12V. A router and a SIM card are included in the package.", "Цена": "850"}, {"Наименование": "Installation, commissioning and configuration", "Модель": "CW000", "Описание краткое": "", "Описание подробное": "Autopilots, echo sounders, AIS, hydraulics, electronics", "Цена": ""}], "files": {"ARC126": [{"name": "00ARC126.png", "id": "disk:/Catalog/00ARC126.png", "mimeType": "image/png", "url": "https://downloader.disk.yandex.ru/disk/8d56f80124ab596206fb7871f11037a222755b5ed008bd483e8a5b3081d31c9a/6aeb6348/fKqInKw3d7bLFOeFnMGnhG6WQj1n6VG9HBP7fMjsn82FCiQqO7xPl4hEksGfBhyS-vdERi7XZ00a4Aq5rJOfzMoSCoDOp-v8M5L37bdjuM-r8npumZHI4midPdWhecNq?uid=1130000033804092&filename=00ARC126.png&disposition=attachment&hash=&limit=0&content_type=image%2Fpng&owner_uid=1130000033804092&fsize=80083&hid=85675ed1d8f8db406e2870fa3cd801ba&